Description: Electric vehicle battery state of health analyzer and certified inspector
 Advanced telemetric battery capacity and State of Health (SOH) analyzer for electric vehicles.
 Calculates usable capacity trajectories using Gaussian local regression (LOWESS) with 95%
 confidence bands, Arrhenius thermal wear kinetics, and generates tamper-evident,
 cryptographically signed PDF inspection certificates.
 Includes CLI tool and native GNOME GTK4 Libadwaita desktop application.
